  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.28 Infrastructure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.28 “Infrastructure” means all structures and all mechanical and electrical equipment that connect a source of water to end users in a water system or that provide source water protection, including but not limited to all sources, treatment, storage, and distribution facilities and the land necessary therefor.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
